#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Depth"
msgstr "Gate Cutting untuk Mengurangi Kedalaman Circuit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, we will reduce a circuit's depth by cutting distant gates, avoiding the swap gates that would otherwise be introduced by routing.\n"
msgstr "Dalam tutorial ini, kita akan mengurangi kedalaman Circuit dengan memotong Gate-Gate yang berjauhan, sehingga menghindari swap gate yang biasanya diperkenalkan oleh proses routing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take in this [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns):\n"
msgstr "Berikut adalah langkah-langkah yang akan kita lakukan dalam [pola Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 1: Petakan masalah ke circuit dan operator kuantum**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Petakan Hamiltonian ke dalam circuit kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 2: Optimalkan untuk hardware target** [_Menggunakan cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Potong Circuit dan observable.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpile subeksperimen untuk hardware.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 3: Eksekusi pada hardware target**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan subeksperimen yang diperoleh dari Langkah 2 menggunakan primitif `Sampler`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 4: Pasca-proses hasil** [_Menggunakan cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Gabungkan hasil dari Langkah 3 untuk merekonstruksi nilai ekspektasi dari observable yang dimaksud.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Petakan {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to run on the backend {#create-a-circuit-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Buat Circuit untuk dijalankan di Backend {#create-a-circuit-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagram circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Tentukan observable {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimalkan {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a backend {#specify-a-backend}"
msgstr "Tentukan Backend {#specify-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can provide either a fake backend or a hardware backend from Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa menyediakan fake backend atau hardware backend dari Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuit, visualize the swaps, and note the depth {#transpile-the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"
msgstr "Transpile Circuit, visualisasikan swap, dan perhatikan kedalamannya {#transpile-the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We choose a layout that requires two swaps to execute the gates between qubits 3 and 0 and another two swaps to return the qubits to their initial positions.\n"
msgstr "Kita memilih layout yang memerlukan dua swap untuk mengeksekusi Gate antara qubit 3 dan 0, dan dua swap lagi untuk mengembalikan qubit ke posisi awalnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagram circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace distant gates with `TwoQubitQPDGate`s by specifying their indices {#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-specifying-their-indices}"
msgstr "Ganti Gate yang berjauhan dengan `TwoQubitQPDGate` berdasarkan indeksnya {#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-specifying-their-indices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`cut_gates` will replace the gates in the specified indices with `TwoQubitQPDGate`s and also return a list of `QPDBasis` instances -- one for each gate decomposition.\n"
msgstr "`cut_gates` akan mengganti Gate pada indeks yang ditentukan dengan `TwoQubitQPDGate` dan juga mengembalikan daftar instance `QPDBasis` — satu untuk setiap dekomposisi Gate.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagram circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Buat subeksperimen untuk dijalankan di Backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts a circuit containing `TwoQubitQPDGate` instances and observables as a `PauliList`.\n"
msgstr "`generate_cutting_experiments` menerima circuit yang berisi instance `TwoQubitQPDGate` dan observable sebagai `PauliList`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by `num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample. For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Untuk mensimulasikan nilai ekspektasi dari circuit berukuran penuh, banyak subeksperimen dibuat dari distribusi kuasiprobabilitas bersama gate yang didekomposisi, lalu dieksekusi pada satu atau lebih Backend. Jumlah sampel yang diambil dari distribusi dikendalikan oleh `num_samples`, dan satu koefisien gabungan diberikan untuk setiap sampel yang unik. Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang cara koefisien dihitung, lihat [materi penjelasan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `generate_cutting_experiments` is of type `PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "**Catatan:** Argumen ``observables`` pada `generate_cutting_experiments` bertipe `PauliList`. Koefisien dan fase dari setiap suku observable diabaikan selama dekomposisi masalah dan eksekusi subeksperimen. Keduanya dapat diterapkan kembali saat rekonstruksi nilai ekspektasi.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr "Hitung overhead sampling untuk pemotongan yang dipilih {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut three CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^3$.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita memotong tiga Gate CNOT, menghasilkan overhead sampling sebesar $9^3$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang overhead sampling yang ditimbulkan oleh circuit cutting, lihat [materi penjelasan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Demonstrate that the QPD subexperiments will be shallower after cutting distant gates {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-shallower-after-cutting-distant-gates}"
msgstr "Tunjukkan bahwa subeksperimen QPD akan lebih dangkal setelah Gate yang berjauhan dipotong {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-shallower-after-cutting-distant-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here is an example of an arbitrarily chosen subexperiment generated from the QPD circuit. Its depth has been reduced by more than half. Many of these probabilistic subexperiments must be generated and evaluated in order to reconstruct an expectation value of the deeper circuit.\n"
msgstr "Berikut adalah contoh salah satu subeksperimen yang dipilih secara acak dari Circuit QPD. Kedalamannya berkurang lebih dari setengahnya. Banyak subeksperimen probabilistik seperti ini harus dibuat dan dievaluasi untuk merekonstruksi nilai ekspektasi dari circuit yang lebih dalam.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagram circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"
msgstr "Siapkan subeksperimen untuk Backend {#prepare-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Eksekusi {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Jalankan subeksperimen menggunakan primitif Qiskit Runtime Sampler {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Pasca-proses {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr "Rekonstruksi nilai ekspektasi {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr "Rekonstruksi nilai ekspektasi untuk setiap suku observable dan gabungkan untuk merekonstruksi nilai ekspektasi dari observable asal.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Bandingkan nilai ekspektasi yang direkonstruksi dengan nilai ekspektasi eksak dari circuit dan observable asal {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
msgstr "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
